{"Address_address2":"Turners Hill Road","Email":"jo@pestalozzi.international","Address_address1":"Unit F8 Worth Corner Business Centre","Website1":"","Website2":"","Number3":"80","Number2":"33000","Number1":"1600","MultiLine5":"The school is registered and maintains dialogue with the relevant government ministries.","SingleLine2":"Pestalozzi International","MultiLine7":"The school has fee-paying pupils as well as Pestalozzi scholars. The profit served from free payers subsidises the costs of tuition for scholars. The school runs domestic ECZ curriculum, Cambridge iGCSE/A-levels and IBDP.  Pestalozzi works with ENKO, a school management company.","SingleLine3":"Sonia Omar","MultiLine1":"Imagine a world where every child‚Äôs innate talents, empathy, and rich diversity of lived experience are nurtured. Where education instills the power to make informed decisions, fuels the fire of ambition, and inspires everyone to shape a brighter tomorrow for all humanity.","SingleLine5":"Director of Education","MultiLine2":"We offer child-centred education to disadvantaged young people in the Global South, supporting economic growth and social mobility. Recognising the uniqueness of every child's fullest potential,  we educate beyond the classroom to develop future-oriented vocational skills and nurture emotional, social and mental well-being. This education for life creates self-reliant adults with the moral confidence to contribute meaningfully to their communities and as global citizens.","MultiLine3":"Our education programmes in Africa and Asia are designed to inspire future leaders and changemakers. Through a holistic approach, we go beyond traditional learning, equipping young people not only with academic and vocational skills but with the confidence and character needed to lead their communities.

Our flagship Future Leaders Programme offers residential scholarships to bright children from the poorest backgrounds. It provides a well-rounded education that nurtures intellectual, emotional, and practical skills, preparing them to become leaders and changemakers in their communities.

Our vocational training centre provides teenagers from disadvantaged backgrounds who are not in school with in-demand training in digital skills, agricultural science, and more. This programme ensures students are well-prepared to enter the modern workforce, care for themselves and contribute to local economies.","Address_zipCode":"RH10 7SL","MultiLine4":"Our alumni are 33 times more likely to finish High School than in the rural areas they are selected from. More than 70% of our alumni actively give back to their communities, with over half working in public service roles that improve lives and promote social progress. Alumni careers contribute to all 17 UN Sustainable Development Goals and over 50 NGO's have been created by them.","Number10":"61","Name_Last":"Nair","MultipleChoice":["India","Nepal","Thailand","Zambia"],"SingleLine31":"","SingleLine32":"","Dropdown":"Yes","SubForm1":[{"firstName":"James","lastName":"Haughton","email7":"james@pestalozziworld.com"},{"firstName":"Jo","lastName":"Nair","email7":"jo@pestalozzi.international"}],"MultipleChoice1":["Grade 1","Grade 2","Grade 3","Grade 4","Grade 5","Grade 6","Grade 7","Grade 8","Grade 9","Grade 10","Grade 11","Grade 12"],"MultipleChoice4":null,"MultipleChoice3":["Girls education","Inclusive education","Secondary education and work readiness","Social and emotional learning"],"Dropdown9":"Yes","Name5_First":"Joanna","Name5_Last":"Nair","Dropdown4":"Yes, all of the countries","Dropdown3":"United Kingdom","Dropdown2":"Non-profit","Dropdown1":"Yes","Dropdown8":"Poor (less than $2 a day)","Dropdown6":"Free","SingleLine":"Director of Education","Dropdown5":"Zero fees","Dropdown10":"Yes","Dropdown11":"No","Dropdown13":"Yes, all our schools","Radio2":"Yes","Radio1":"Yes","Dropdown15":"GSF member","MonthYear":"Jun-1995","Website":"www.pestalozzi.international","Name_First":"Joanna","MultiLine":"","Name4_First":"Joanna","Name4_Last":"Nair","Number":"1","Email6":"sonia@pestalozzi.international","SubForm":[{"firstName":"Helen","lastName":"Leale-Green","jobTitle":"CEO","organisation":"Our Moon Education","email":"helen.leale-green@ourmoon.org.uk"},{"firstName":"Jyoti","lastName":"Pandey","jobTitle":"Director of Programs","organisation":"Samaanta Foundation","email":"jmpandey@gmail.com"}],"Email1":"jo@pestalozzi.international","Email2":"jo@pestalozzi.international","Address_country":"United Kingdom","Address_city":"Crawley"}

